    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goofy Lil Guys is an Award Winning, cute 2-4 local multiplayer split-screen creature collector game with battleroyale elements tied in. You and your friends will need to find, fight, and tame a team of Little Guys before the storm closes in. Once the skies darken, its last team standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 160 different possible team compositions, players can always try something new! Explore our 3D world inhabited with our adorable 2D creatures, learn and fight with new gimmicks and combo's as you take on the wild creatures in the world. Then, when the time is right, unleash your powerful team against your opponents and come out victorious.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goofy Lil Guys is an Award Winning, cute 2-4 local multiplayer split-screen creature collector game with battleroyale elements tied in. You and your friends will need to find, fight, and tame a team of Little Guys before the storm closes in. Once the skies darken, its last team standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 160 different possible team compositions, players can always try something new! Explore our 3D world inhabited with our adorable 2D creatures, learn and fight with new gimmicks and combo's as you take on the wild creatures in the world. Then, when the time is right, unleash your powerful team against your opponents and come out victorious.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this action real time local PvPvE game, players will collect a team of adorable creatures and harness their unique abilities in order to grow stronger before the final fight to the death. 2-4 local players can engage in this cute spin of split-screen battleroyale creature collection.",
